everyone expecting Southern District of New&nbsp;
York to be the never ending thorn in Trump's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.840
side in Georgia? Jumping ahead very quickly&nbsp;
now from the standpoint of Trump's defense.&nbsp;&nbsp;

